('Selection and execution','I selected 40 original GDPval gold tasks across eight occupations, using all five public tasks in each occupation. The slice targets inspectable document and spreadsheet decisions. Selection expanded in stages and is purposive. I lead with the latest 20-task cohort; the earlier 15 API tasks and five in-app tasks used different setups and remain separate. Constructed probes and retries are not additional original tasks.'),
